# Flutter regenerates these on every `flutter pub get` (and so on every
# `flutter test` run), and it writes them with LF endings. With
# core.autocrlf=true git checks them out as CRLF, so each regeneration left
# all three showing as modified with no change in content - churn that was
# easy to commit by accident. Pinning them to LF makes the checkout match what
# Flutter writes.
windows/flutter/generated_* text eol=lf
